WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:01.901
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.200
We're talking with
Ewan McGregor,

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.934
who you can see in
the new "Star Wars" series

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:07.334
"Obi-Wan Kenobi."

00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:10.334
In "Obi-Wan Kenobi," our pal,
Hayden Christensen,

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:12.267
returns for the first time
as Darth Vader.

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:13.434
-Yeah.

00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:14.701
-What's it like
working with Hayden again?

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:16.167
-It's lovely to work with
Hayden again.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:17.767
We spent such
a long time together.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:20.667
We shot episode 2 and 3
in Australia,

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.601
in Sydney, Australia,
back in the day.

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.367
And so we spent
a lot of time on set

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:25.534
and we had
a lot of fight training to do

00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:26.701
and we spent
a lot of time off set.

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:27.801
So, it was nice to
see him again.

00:00:27.801 --> 00:00:29.000
-Yeah, he's a good guy.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.334
-It was frightening to see
him again, though,

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:32.567
in the -- I hadn't acted with
Darth Vader, you know.

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:33.767
-Oh, yeah.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:36.734
-So -- And I've
been acting a long time.

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:39.200
I think I've done
a lot of stuff.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.834
But the first take
with Darth Vader

00:00:40.834 --> 00:00:42.501
scared the [bleep] out of me.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:45.868
It's true.
-'Cause he's just frightening.

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:48.000
-Yeah, we rehearsed, and he
didn't have the helmet on.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.167
And I was --
Then I was getting made up,

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:51.534
and I guess they were
sorting him out.

00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:53.367
And then they went, "Action!"

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:55.200
And I'm walking down
and I hear something.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.100
I turn around,
to [bleep] Vader's coming at me.

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.300
I swear to God.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.100
I just about [bleep]
my pants, really.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.200
-Yeah. But, I mean,
when you're a kid,

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.300
that is probably one of
the scariest villains you see.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.434
-That's it, I think.
-A lot of people say that.

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.234
-I was like 7 years old again.

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:13.601
It was really like a --
It was really genuine fear.

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:15.334
I've made
horror films and stuff.

00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:16.667
They're not frightening.
But that was.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:17.901
-That was, yeah.

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:20.200
The series is pretty much
shrouded in secrecy,

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:24.300
but that does not stop fans
from having ideas or speculating

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.467
what might happen or what they
hope might happen in the series.

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:28.601
I was thinking,
if it's okay with you,

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:29.801
can I ask you a couple things?

00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:31.467
You don't have to say
"yes" or "no," but --

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:32.501
-Oh, okay.

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:33.901
-But you can answer
the best you can,

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:35.033
and we can try to figure out if

00:01:35.033 --> 00:01:36.033
some of these things
are happening.

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:37.501
-Okay.

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:39.601
-Fans want to know if we'll see
Obi-Wan Kenobi interact with

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:41.334
a young Luke Skywalker?

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:44.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:45.534
Okay.
-[ Breathes deeply ]

00:01:45.534 --> 00:01:48.501
-Wow! Wow! Wow!
Okay, just an exhale.

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:50.067
That one just got an exhale.

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:52.567
Okay, okay.
-Maybe. Maybe.

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:54.367
-Okay. I'll take the "maybe."

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:57.868
It did get an exhale,
which is pretty good.

00:01:57.868 --> 00:01:59.133
The fans are gonna
look into that.

00:01:59.133 --> 00:02:01.400
Fans are hoping to see
exploration of

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.200
the galaxy and other planets.

00:02:06.734 --> 00:02:10.534
Wow. Okay, that was an exhale,
but then swallowed it back.

00:02:10.534 --> 00:02:11.667
You swallowed it back.
-Yeah.

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:13.133
-It came out,
and then you go, "Nope."

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.868
-I didn't want to repeat -- I
didn't want to repeat myself.

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.667
-No, of course. Yeah.

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:20.267
Oh, fans want to know if
there's a new droid sidekick.

00:02:22.467 --> 00:02:25.234
Wow! That got a shift.

00:02:25.234 --> 00:02:27.334
That got a shift and a flip.
-There might be.

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:28.534
-That got a shift and a flip.

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.400
'Cause that's always fun,
if there's a new --

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.634
-Shift flips.
-No, yeah.

00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:33.834
But, no, but if they --
The ship lapse.

00:02:33.834 --> 00:02:35.634
-Oh.
-A -- Yeah, exactly.

00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:36.667
Flip ships, yeah.

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:38.367
If there's are new --
a new droid,

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:40.000
a new little buddy to
hang out with,

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.434
that's kind of fun.

00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:44.534
Okay.

00:02:44.534 --> 00:02:47.033
Fans want to know if
we're going to see Obi-Wan

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.234
try to redeem Darth Vader.

00:02:49.234 --> 00:02:50.801
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:02:50.801 --> 00:02:52.300
-[ Exhales sharply ]
-Wow!

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:55.367
That one got a Steel --
Like Blue Steel looking at me.

00:02:55.367 --> 00:02:56.534
You looked through
my soul there.

00:02:56.534 --> 00:02:57.901
-Yeah.

00:02:57.901 --> 00:03:00.634
-Because you guys -- You guys
are basically brothers.

00:03:00.634 --> 00:03:01.934
You kind of started together,

00:03:01.934 --> 00:03:03.300
and then he went to
the dark side.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.701
And then -- You know.

00:03:06.467 --> 00:03:09.000
Okay. Alright.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.667
Uh -- Ooh! Then the last one.

00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:13.868
Fans want to see a rematch
between Obi-Wan and Darth Vader.

00:03:13.868 --> 00:03:17.634
[ Audience cheers ]
That one got a "Whoo!"

00:03:17.634 --> 00:03:18.767
Okay.

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:20.067
Alright, that one got a smile.

00:03:20.067 --> 00:03:21.968
I'm going to take that
as something.

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.300
What can we say?

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.601
Because I've seen every trailer
I think known to man

00:03:25.601 --> 00:03:26.601
that I can see about this thing.

00:03:26.601 --> 00:03:28.868
-Yeah.
-It's on Disney+.

00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:30.400
They do such a great job,
by the way.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:31.467
-It's so cool.

00:03:31.467 --> 00:03:35.067
It really is a nice --
It really is.

00:03:35.067 --> 00:03:39.067
It sits like 8, 10 years
after "Episode III,"

00:03:39.067 --> 00:03:43.033
and there's lots of, like,
satisfying threads between

00:03:43.033 --> 00:03:44.767
"Episode III:
Revenge of the Sith"

00:03:44.767 --> 00:03:46.267
and "A New Hope"
with Alec Guinness.

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:47.834
And I think, you know,

00:03:47.834 --> 00:03:51.067
we spent a long time finding
the right story to tell.

00:03:51.067 --> 00:03:52.968
And Deborah Chow is such
a brilliant director,

00:03:52.968 --> 00:03:54.467
and she directed all
the episodes.

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:57.501
And she tells it her way,
so it's really --

00:03:57.501 --> 00:03:58.801
It's really got her mark on it.

00:03:58.801 --> 00:04:00.801
And it's pretty --
I've seen them all,

00:04:00.801 --> 00:04:02.434
and I think they're really good.

00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:03.501
So I think people
will not be disappointed.

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:04.534
-There you go.

00:04:04.534 --> 00:04:06.701
I'm going to take it
from you, bud.

00:04:06.701 --> 00:04:08.300
We love you.
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:11.501
Here's Ewan McGregor in
"Obi-Wan Kenobi."

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:12.901
Take a look at this.

00:04:12.901 --> 00:04:15.634
-There's more to life
than your farm, Owen.

00:04:15.634 --> 00:04:17.067
He needs to see that.

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:18.667
There's a whole galaxy
out there.

00:04:18.667 --> 00:04:22.000
-I'm asking you to
leave us alone, Ben.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.601
I mean it.

00:04:23.601 --> 00:04:24.601
-Is he okay?

00:04:24.601 --> 00:04:28.934
-You don't care if he's okay.

00:04:28.934 --> 00:04:30.267
You care if he's showing.

00:04:30.267 --> 00:04:32.868
-He's my responsibility, Owen.
-Well, I'm his uncle.

00:04:32.868 --> 00:04:33.968
-We talked about this.

00:04:33.968 --> 00:04:35.200
When the time comes,

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.367
he must be trained.

00:04:36.367 --> 00:04:37.834
-Like you trained his father?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.200
-Whoa!
-Come on.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:43.667
-Snap!
That's what I'm talking about!

00:04:43.667 --> 00:04:44.968
Ewan McGregor, everybody.

00:04:44.968 --> 00:04:49.634
"Obi-Wan Kenobi" premieres
this Friday on Disney+.

